# Input

```md
Some words before the strong text, **stop and tell
them** after the strong text.

Some words before the strong text, __stop and tell
them__ after the strong text.

Some words before the italic text, *stop and tell
them* after the italic text.

Some words before the deleted text, ~~stop and tell
them~~ after the deleted text.

**A strong span that is much longer than the configured line width.**

Before **strong with _nested italic words_ inside it** after.

Words to fill the line here **strong - with a marker** after.

Words to fill the line here and **strong - with a marker** after.

Text __foo bar___ after.

**short** words that are not split *x*.

- List item with enough words, **strong text that
  continues** on the next line.

> Quote with enough words in it, **strong text that
> continues** on the next line.

> Quote with enough words in it, **strong text on one line** after.

Some words before the strong text, ***stop and tell
them*** after the strong text.

Some words before the strong text, **_stop and tell
them_** after the strong text.

Lorem ipsum ***consectetur adipiscing elit sed do eiusmod*** ut labore.

Paragraph with *foo ** bar* text and **foo __ bar** text.

> Quote with words, **strong *italic that
> continues* more words here** after the text.

> Short **strong text that is quite long and must wrap** after the strong.

Some text here **foo !_1_2 bar** and **a _b__ c** and **a __b___ c** end.

Escaped a __ b *c__ d* end.

```


# Options

```json
{
  "markdown": {
    "formatter": {
      "proseWrap": "always",
      "lineWidth": 40,
      "indentStyle": "space"
    }
  }
}
```

